fixture walk_steps_down_small_lips
doc Physics review 4: walking LEFT down the lips that walk_steps_up_small_lips walks up: box B (8 u proud) down onto the tiles at x 960, then the tiles down onto box A (1 u lower) at x 480.
room test/box_steps
spawn 1100 536
frames 90
input
  0..89 L
end
expect
  # Down these lips, as up them (walk_steps_up_small_lips), the walk never leaves the ground.
  never 0..89 state=air
  never 0..89 event.land=1
end
